# Atomic Design — generic vs. domain boundary

## Principle

- **`src/ui/atoms`**, **`src/ui/molecules`**, and **`src/ui/organisms`**: only **generic, reusable** components that could ship in a design system or be copied to another React project without Mind Bridge types, routes, branding, or product copy.
- **`src/ui/templates`**: layout and UI blocks **tied to Mind Bridge** (psychologist/patient flows, AI chat, admin prompts, branded auth, domain i18n keys, `@api` DTOs, `@services` hooks).

## Quick checklist (before creating in atoms/molecules/organisms)

Ask: *Could this component exist unchanged in a different SaaS app?*

| Signal | Layer |
|--------|--------|
| Props are `label`, `value`, `onChange`, `children`, neutral data | atoms / molecules / organisms |
| Uses Mind Bridge DTOs (`AiPromptTokenDefinitionDto`, `ClinicalChatMessageDto`, …) | **templates** |
| Hard-coded routes (`/psychologist/…`, `/patient/…`) or role sidebars | **templates** |
| Product i18n keys (`ADMIN_PROMPTS_*`, `PSYCHOLOGIST_*`, `CHAT_*`) | **templates** |
| Brand CSS (`mb-auth-login-card`, `mb-kpi-card`, `mb-chat-sender-icon`) | **templates** |
| Domain helpers (`parseInteractionSummary`, psychologist route builders) | **templates** |
| `@services` / Supabase hooks inside the component | **templates** |

## Generic examples (atoms / molecules / organisms)

- `Button`, `Card`, `FormGroup`, `Table`, `ConfirmModal`, `Calendar`, `Sidebar`, `SidebarNavItem`
- Chat-agnostic patterns only if props stay neutral and styling is token-based without product classes

## Domain examples (templates — current project)

- `templates/auth/AuthFormCard` — Mind Bridge login branding
- `templates/admin/PromptTemplateEditor` — AI prompt tokens + admin copy
- `templates/chat/*` — `ChatPanel`, `ChatMessageBubble`, `InteractionSummaryBody`
- `templates/dashboard/DashboardKpiCard` — psychologist dashboard KPI styling
- `templates/layout/PsychologistSidebar`, `PatientSidebar` — role navigation

## Organization

- Reusable building blocks → `atoms` / `molecules` / `organisms` + export from layer `index.ts`
- Product-specific blocks → `templates/[feature]/` + export from `templates/index.ts`
- Full pages and route composition → `src/ui/components/` (may import from `@templates`)

## Imports

- **templates** may import `@atoms`, `@molecules`, `@organisms`, `@api`, `@services`, `@i18n`
- **molecules/organisms** must not import from `@templates`
- Avoid domain DTOs in generic layers; pass already-mapped neutral props instead
